2. ✅ **SQL Injection - Password Parameter (Critical)**
3. ✅ **Error-Based Information Disclosure (High)**
4. ✅ **Database Schema Enumeration (High)**
5. ✅ **Hardcoded Secrets in Database (Critical)**
6. ✅ **Credential Exposure (Critical)**
7. ✅ **API Key Exposure (Critical)**
8. ✅ **JWT Secret Exposure (Critical)**
9. ✅ **AWS Credentials Exposure (Critical)**
10. ✅ **Third-party Service Token Exposure (Critical)**
11. ✅ **CRLF Injection / Log Forging (Medium)**
12. ✅ **Null Byte Injection (Medium)**
13. ✅ **Weak/Plaintext Password Storage (Medium)**
14. ✅ **Missing Input Validation (Medium)**
