16. ✅ **Verbose Error Messages (Information Disclosure)**
17. ✅ **No Account Lockout (Brute Force Possible)**
18. ✅ **No CSRF Protection Tokens (Form-based)**
19. ✅ **No Rate Limiting (Brute Force/DoS Possible)**

